OL,3,AParents jailed for torture and death of
OL,4,Afour-year-old girl in France in 1987
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a four-year-old girl
OL,7,Fkilled in central France and found
OL,8,Falong a motorway almost 40 years ago
OL,9,Fhas been sentenced to 20 years in
OL,10,Fprison.
OL,12,FHalima El Bakhti, 72, was found guilty
OL,13,Fon Tuesday of "torture and acts of
OL,14,Fbarbarity resulting in death without
OL,15,Fthe intent to kill", French media
OL,16,Freports.
OL,18,FThe girl's father, 74-year-old Ahmed
OL,19,FTouloub, was handed a 15-year sentence
OL,20,Fas an accomplice.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
