OL,3,AParents jailed for torture and death of
OL,4,Afour-year-old girl in France in 1987
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour-year-old Inass Touloub was found
OL,7,Falong the A10 road in Suevres in the
OL,8,FLoir-et-Cher department on 11 August
OL,9,F1987. Her body bore multiple marks of
OL,10,Fabuse, including human bite marks,
OL,11,Fbroken bones and burns with an iron.
